Subject: [LAB 7/7] media: rkvdec: rebuild complete SPS RPS tables and fail closed

Local experimental followup, not submitted upstream. Original files retain their attribution.
Removes incomplete single-set cache, validates derived final sets, propagates assembly
failures through both backends and completes each prepared request before returning.

